0..78 Comment "// A record type\'s faces refused: one face holds a label the record lacks, and"
79..159 Comment "// one face is named twice. A static bracket refused: it names a field or a face"
160..234 Comment "// that the record type lacks. Another bracket fixes a field at a value of"
235..310 Comment "// another type. A record literal at a patched type states a fixed field at"
311..386 Comment "// another value, and so does a configuration coerced in to a patched type."
387..389 Comment "//"
390..469 Comment "// A face lists only labels its record holds, and each face has its own name. A"
470..549 Comment "// static bracket fixes only the fields its record type writes, and a face only"
550..624 Comment "// when the type member names it. Each refusal stands at the label, at the"
625..704 Comment "// second name or at the face, by its name. A fixed value has its field\'s type,"
705..778 Comment "// and the refusal stands at the value. A fixed field holds the value the"
779..854 Comment "// bracket fixes, and the refusal stands at the field or the configuration."
855..857 Comment "//"
858..934 Comment "// The types stand in a module, whose members carry the verdict each refusal"
935..994 Comment "// states. Each refusal names the face and the record type."
995..997 Comment "//"
998..1080 Comment "// - see: `model/desc/record-faces.gandr` — the faces read, and the bracket read"
1081..1162 Comment "// - see: `pathological/desc/shaped-signature.gandr` — a theory\'s faces refused"
1163..1173 Comment "//   alike"
